    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "t200201",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 545,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "The proposer never writes the lexicon.\nA default key can create; only an admin key can decide.\n\nAn undecided proposal leaves the engine's own reading in place,\nwhich is the safe default: no review means no change.",
      "originalText": "The proposer never writes the lexicon.\nA default key can create; only an admin key can decide.\n\nAn undecided proposal leaves the engine's own reading in place,\nwhich is the safe default: no review means no change.",
